Z||000000||Sootah||12-16-2001||01:03 AM||||Allright, now I don't expect anything from this (well, other than some of the more hot-headed members of this forum makeing fun of me) but I need  either a co-signer or a loan. My 85 GT (see sig) tossed a rod and I can no longer use the car I have been borrowing up until now. This wouldn't be a big deal as I could ride a bike or something if it were not for the fact that I live 14 miles out of town. Now you see the rather desperate situation I am in.<P>I'm 19, working 2 jobs, and have no real expenses (Living w/ parents. Yes, it is sad). They would sign with me but they are rather strapped at the moment as they just got this house. My father is an ass; after coming to live with my mother he has essentially disowned me so he won't help. I have also asked my uncle but he is on my fathers side of the family and my dad has a rather large mouth. Banks will not touch me because I have no previous credit history (19).<P>For a co-signer I'd give $100, or for a loan straight from you I'd use the title to the car as collateral and be willing to pay some higher interest. The title would actually be decent collateral seeing as soon as I have the funds there will be an engine going into the car.<P>E-Mail me for contact info if you want to speak directly to me. PM if you'd like but I don't check that all that often (don't ever remember to).<P>*Dons abspestos suit*<P>Thank you,<BR>    <B><I>-Sootah</B></I><P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Sootah__tig_sig2.gif">           <BR><sup><A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Sootah__Black_Beauty_-_Front_Right.jpg" TARGET=_blank>The Black Beauty</A> (85 GT) - <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Sootah__Busted-Ass_SE.jpg" TARGET=_blank>Bustedato</A> (86 SE, Parts car)<BR><I>Don't sweat the petty things, and don't pet the sweaty things</I></sup> <BR><sup><B>AOL IM</B>: KSSouter<BR><B>MSN IM</B>: I_R_Sootah@hotmail.com<BR></sup>||||reg||2
