Z||000035||topcat||12-31-2001||06:09 PM||||WCF, you guys are beyond awsome.  Stuff like this restores my faith in humanity.  I am new to Fieros.. Always wanted one, made it to mid life and bought 2.  My girlfriend calls me obsessed, I may be just a little.  anyway the next time I am looking for parts, or anything, I will know where to look first... of course paying.  You guys have won over this middle aged, obsessed Fiero fanatic!<P>BTW, can someone tell me what BUMP means?  I see it in numerous post, but am cluless.<P><P>------------------<BR>||||reg||14
Z||000036||SLYGUY||12-31-2001||06:12 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by topcat:<P><B>BTW, can someone tell me what BUMP means?  I see it in numerous post, but am cluless.<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>When someone types only the word "bump" that means that they want to bump that topic and all of it's reponses to the top of the list of topics in that category. The reason is mostly for more notice.<BR>Sly||||reg||1
